 "description": "Scorecard 4-digit CIP (2020) -> ACS PUMS field of bachelor's degree (FOD1P). Many-to-many.",
 "method": [
  "Each CIP 2020 6-digit code under the 4-digit code is traced back to CIP 2010 and CIP 2000 with the NCES crosswalks.",
  "CIP 2000 6-digit codes map to ACS (HHES) field-of-degree codes via the Census Bureau workbook 'ACS Field of Degree Classification - HHES/CIP/NSF Crosswalk (3/05/2009)', sheet 'CIP code by HHES code'.",
  "Census internal codes are translated to public PUMS FOD1P codes via that workbook's sheet 'Crosswalk 2009-10' (blank PUMS cells continue the code above, merged cells).",
  "CIP codes NCES marks as new since 2000 (no predecessor) are left unmapped; no mappings are inferred."
 ],
